          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "फेरीवाला (pherīvālā) is pherī, \"a round\", with -वाला: the man who makes the rounds of the lanes. pherī belongs with phirati, \"turns, wanders\", a form CDIAL reconstructs (CDIAL 9078), which lists Hindi pher, \"a turn\"."
